# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
phase2_B6_figure_polish_package.py

B6 Figure Polish Package v3
Post-processing only: no simulation, no guidance modification.

v3 fixes
--------
1) Does not crash if a bad/missing subfolder exists under store/data_saved.
2) Ground-track search is optional and safely skipped if no trajectory CSV is found.
3) B5F timeout/no-CSV annotation no longer raises All-NaN warnings.
4) Figures 1-4 are always written if B5E/B5F summary CSVs exist.
"""

